Per-install certificates: of the ISDS accounts (the constants AA_APIKEY_ISDS..._CERT and _KEY in include/config.php;
a relative path starts here) and of the older data-box client in misc/datovka (see
misc/datovka/datovka_conf.php). The directory is versioned only through this file: git does not keep
empty directories, and the certificates themselves are per-install and ignored.

This directory lies in the tree the web server serves, and some servers ignore .htaccess. A file that
holds a private key belongs outside the directory of AA, named by a full path; kept here, only its owner
may read it (chmod 600) - State Check reports one the group or others may read.
